{"id":1499,"title":"and、or 和 not 运算符","summary":"and、or 和 not 运算符","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ca937458-4841-360f-ba02-e56926f7a4ea","knowledge_id":181,"title":"and、or 和 not 运算符","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":181,"title":"and、or 和 not 运算符","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"23b8a712-54cd-3bc7-ab96-08021ead58c9","title":"","title_html":"","text":"`and`、`or`和`not`是 Python 中的**布尔操作符**。它们用于比较两个布尔值。\n\n**`and`运算符**:\n\n如果比较的两个值都是 `True`，则 `and` 操作符返回 `True`。在其他情况下，`and` 运算符返回`假`。\n\n**例如:**","text_html":"<p><code>and</code>、<code>or</code>和<code>not</code>是 Python 中的<strong>布尔操作符</strong>。它们用于比较两个布尔值。</p>\n<p><strong><code>and</code>运算符</strong>:</p>\n<p>如果比较的两个值都是 <code>True</code>，则 <code>and</code> 操作符返回 <code>True</code>。在其他情况下，<code>and</code> 运算符返回<code>假</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>例如:</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7c1670e0-628e-3a64-a4ad-97738aac6eec","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"print(True and True)  # True\nprint(True and False)  # False\nprint(False and True)  # False\nprint(False and False)  # False","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e2fae41a-7641-311b-aec2-0292c14486b7","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**`or`运算符**:\n\n如果比较值中有一个为 `True`，则 `or` 运算符返回`True`；如果两个比较值都为`False`，则 `or` 运算符仅返回`False`。\n\n**例如:**","text_html":"<p><strong><code>or</code>运算符</strong>:</p>\n<p>如果比较值中有一个为 <code>True</code>，则 <code>or</code> 运算符返回<code>True</code>；如果两个比较值都为<code>False</code>，则 <code>or</code> 运算符仅返回<code>False</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>例如:</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"69d274ef-e130-399b-8858-aac91338dfd3","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"print(True or True)  # True\nprint(True or False)  # True\nprint(False or True)  # True\nprint(False or False)  # False","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8af7fc0a-7377-3521-a859-326cdefc35f2","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**`not`运算符**:\n\n`not`运算符反转布尔值，即`True`值反转为`False`值，反之亦然。\n\n**例如:**","text_html":"<p><strong><code>not</code>运算符</strong>:</p>\n<p><code>not</code>运算符反转布尔值，即<code>True</code>值反转为<code>False</code>值，反之亦然。</p>\n<p><strong>例如:</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6965956d-a80b-38c7-b8b7-79c176b6641a","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"print(not True)  # False\nprint(not False)  # True","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":5}]}}],"status":"